    "original": "Crafting facilities can be placed on your property and offer temporary boosts while crafting.<hex:02100103><hex:02100103>■Number Permitted<hex:02100103>The number of crafting facilities allowed varies according to the estate type.<hex:02100103>　・Private chamber: 2<hex:02100103>　・Apartment: 2<hex:02100103>　・Small estate hall (cottage): 4<hex:02100103>　・Medium estate hall (house): 6<hex:02100103>　・Large estate hall (mansion): 8<hex:02100103><hex:02100103>■Types of Crafting Facility<hex:02100103>There are eight varieties in total, one for each Disciple of the Hand class.<hex:02100103>　・Carpenter: Woodworking bench<hex:02100103>　・Blacksmith: Smithing bench<hex:02100103>　・Armorer: Armorcraft forge<hex:02100103>　・Goldsmith: Goldsmithing bench<hex:02100103>　・Leatherworker: Leatherworking bench<hex:02100103>　・Weaver: Clothcraft loom<hex:02100103>　・Alchemist: Alchemy furnace<hex:02100103>　・Culinarian: Cooking stove<hex:02100103><hex:02100103>",
